{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Static helper class providing various utilities to merge two scenes. It is intended as internal utility and NOT for use by applications. \par
}

{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
The class is currently being used by various postprocessing steps and loaders (ie. LWS). \par
}}
